{"text":"And they've been raised to expect so little of men that the idea of men as savage beings without any control is somehow acceptable. We teach girls shame. Close your legs, cover yourself. We make them feel as though by being born female they're already guilty of something. And so girls grow up to be women who cannot say they have desire. They grow up to be women who silence themselves. They grow up to be women who cannot say what they truly think. And they grow up, and this is the worst thing we do to girls, they grow up to be women who have turned pretense into an art form. I know a woman who hates domestic work. She just hates it. But she pretends that she likes it because she's been taught.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.86},{"text":"they've","start":0.86,"end":1.04},{"text":"been","start":1.04,"end":1.14},{"text":"raised","start":1.14,"end":1.36},{"text":"to","start":1.36,"end":1.7},{"text":"expect","start":1.7,"end":2.44},{"text":"so","start":2.44,"end":2.86},{"text":"little","start":2.86,"end":3.04},{"text":"of","start":3.04,"end":3.28},{"text":"men","start":3.28,"end":3.62},{"text":"that","start":3.62,"end":4.04},{"text":"the","start":4.04,"end":4.18},{"text":"idea","start":4.18,"end":4.68},{"text":"of","start":4.68,"end":5.16},{"text":"men","start":5.16,"end":5.44},{"text":"as","start":5.44,"end":5.6},{"text":"savage","start":5.6,"end":6.16},{"text":"beings","start":6.16,"end":6.64},{"text":"without","start":6.64,"end":7.0},{"text":"any","start":7.0,"end":7.22},{"text":"control","start":7.22,"end":7.6},{"text":"is","start":7.6,"end":7.78},{"text":"somehow","start":7.78,"end":8.04},{"text":"acceptable","start":8.04,"end":8.58,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":10.08,"end":10.4},{"text":"teach","start":10.4,"end":10.62},{"text":"girls","start":10.62,"end":10.96},{"text":"shame","start":10.96,"end":11.36,"punct":"."},{"text":"Close","start":12.4,"end":12.5},{"text":"your","start":12.5,"end":12.68},{"text":"legs","start":12.68,"end":12.96,"pu